a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions\" title=\"Champion of Champions\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_2\" title=\"Champion of Champions 2\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_3\" title=\"Champion of Champions 3\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_4\" title=\"Champion of Champions 4\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_5\" title=\"Champion of Champions 5\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><small>New Year Treat:</small> <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_1\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_2\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_3\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_4\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_5\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_6\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">6</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_7\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_noise_that_blue_makes.\" title=\"The noise that blue makes.\">The noise that blue makes.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Birdy_hand_finger.\" title=\"Birdy hand finger.\">Birdy hand finger.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">I think I've got this.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoe_Who.\" title=\"Shoe Who.\">Shoe Who.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Having_a_little_chuckle.\" title=\"Having a little chuckle.\">Having a little chuckle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_75th_question.\" title=\"The 75th question.\">The 75th question.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heg.\" title=\"Heg.\">Heg.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/You_tuper_super.\" title=\"You tuper super.\">You tuper super.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It_might_be_wind.\" title=\"It might be wind.\">It might be wind.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_House_Queens.\" title=\"The House Queens.\">The House Queens.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">I think I've got this.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/I_think_I%27ve_got_this..png/revision/latest?cb=20220430135812\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"I think I&#39;ve got this.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/I_think_I%27ve_got_this..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220430135812\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/I_think_I%27ve_got_this..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220430135812 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/I_think_I%27ve_got_this..png/revision/latest?cb=20220430135812 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"I think I&#39;ve got this.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"I_think_I%27ve_got_this..png\" data-image-name=\"I think I&#39;ve got this..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_13\" title=\"Series 13\">13</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bridget_Christie\" title=\"Bridget Christie\">Bridget Christie</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Birdy_hand_finger.\" title=\"Birdy hand finger.\">Birdy hand finger.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoe_Who.\" title=\"Shoe Who.\">Shoe Who.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>I think I've got this.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_13\" title=\"Series 13\">Series 13</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 28 April 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Bridget_Christie\" title=\"Bridget Christie\">Bridget Christie</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"I think I've got this\" was uttered multiple times by <a href=\"/wiki/Judi_Love\" title=\"Judi Love\">Judi Love</a>, during her attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_all_these_things_happen_at_the_same_time\" title=\"Make all these things happen at the same time\">Make all these things happen at the same time</a> task. The title card is an aesthetic shot of a marble, referencing the marble needing to roll in the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_all_these_things_happen_at_the_same_time\" title=\"Make all these things happen at the same time\">Make all these things happen at the same time</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jeg tror, jeg klarer det', which translates as 'I think I'll make it'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tämä taitaa onnistua', which translates as 'I think this will work'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Klon av en kon', which translates as 'Clone of a cone'. This is a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Ramsey\" title=\"Chris Ramsey\">Chris Ramsey</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Accurately_and_emotionally_recreate_a_great_moment_from_history_using_these_two_traffic_cones\" title=\"Accurately and emotionally recreate a great moment from history using these two traffic cones\">Accurately and emotionally recreate a great moment from history using these two traffic cones</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jeg tror jeg klarer denne', which translates as 'I think I've got this'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ardal_O%27Hanlon\" title=\"Ardal O&#39;Hanlon\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ardal O'Hanlon</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bridget_Christie\" title=\"Bridget Christie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bridget Christie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Ramsey\" title=\"Chris Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Chris Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Judi_Love\" title=\"Judi Love\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Judi Love</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Duker\" title=\"Sophie Duker\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sophie Duker</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_item_that_sounds_funniest_when_you_say_its_name_over_and_over_again\" title=\"The item that sounds funniest when you say its name over and over again\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The item that sounds funniest when you say its name over and over again.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Accurately_and_emotionally_recreate_a_great_moment_from_history_using_these_two_traffic_cones\" title=\"Accurately and emotionally recreate a great moment from history using these two traffic cones\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Accurately and emotionally recreate a great moment from history using these two traffic cones. Most accurate and emotional recreation wins.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_all_these_things_happen_at_the_same_time\" title=\"Make all these things happen at the same time\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make all of these things happen at the same time. The monsters must be squatting. The robot must be walking. The marble must be rolling. The cradle must be clicking. The sand must be falling. The fidget spinner must be spinning. The candles must be out. You must applaud when you think you've finished. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enable_Alex_to_bite_his_duck\" title=\"Enable Alex to bite his duck\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Enable Alex to bite his duck. You may not encroach upon the decking. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> for the person who gets Alex the least wet.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/As_a_team,_put_one_of_your_faces_and_one_of_your_legs_through_the_hole\" title=\"As a team, put one of your faces and one of your legs through the hole\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> As a team, put one of your faces and one of your legs through the hole. The Taskmaster will guess whether the leg belongs to the face or the other contestant. Most wrong guesses after three rounds wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>6</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>6</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>6</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">25\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bridget's score of 25 points is the highest in an episode spanning 5 tasks, beating Joe Thomas' record set in <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/This_is_Trevor.\" title=\"This is Trevor.\">This is Trevor.</a></span>.\n<ul><li>By scoring 6 points in the live task and winning the 'Enable Alex to bite his duck' task and receiving a bonus point, Bridget became the first contestant to score more than 5 points in multiple tasks in an episode.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Videos\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Videos\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Series_13,_Episode_3_Outtakes_-_Bloopers_-_Taskmaster\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/58/Series_13%2C_Episode_3_Outtakes_-_Bloopers_-_Taskmaster/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220503192904\" alt=\"Series_13,_Episode_3_Outtakes_-_Bloopers_-_Taskmaster\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Series_13,_Episode_3_Outtakes_-_Bloopers_-_Taskmaster\" data-video-name=\"Series 13, Episode 3 Outtakes - Bloopers - Taskmaster\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I_think_I%27ve_got_this.?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/i-think-i%E2%80%99ve-got\"><i>I think I've got this.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70914-0